# Local secret values for comp-report. COPY THIS TO .env AND FILL IT IN.
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored and CI refuses a committed one. Fake values are fine -
# this file only exists so `insights serve` and `insights run` work locally.
#
# In dev and prod none of this is used: the platform injects each value from
#     insights/comp-report/<secret-name>
# using this app's own identity - written by your team, unreadable by the
# platform team (an explicit IAM Deny, not a promise).

hr-warehouse-token=
